Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.KaryAbnorm
Column name: RefNo Type: INT64 Description: reference number, eg '14620'
Column name: CaseNo Type: STRING Description: case number, most frequently an integer between 1 and 10, but can also be an arbitrary string, eg '11H046'
